                    <chunk name="param_input" index="8">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Upwind terrain class from the revised Davenport roughness classification (Davenport 1960; Wieringa 1992; Davenport, Grimmond, Oke &amp; Wieringa 2000): 1 Sea 0.0002 m · 2 Smooth 0.005 m · 3 Open 0.03 m · 4 Roughly open 0.1 m · 5 Rough 0.25 m · 6 Very rough 0.5 m · 7 Skimming 1 m · 8 Chaotic 2 m. Picking a class sets the roughness length z0 from the table (shown on the banner); Custom uses the Roughness Length input instead. Describe the terrain the wind CROSSES upwind of the site, not the site itself.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">3c8510e0-991c-4f4e-b241-ab5f052e521a</item>
                        <item name="Multiple" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
