                    <chunk name="param_input" index="15">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PIMPLE only: how long to simulate, in SECONDS of physical time (the steady solver's Iterations input is ignored). Size it from the domain flow-through time L/U - the statistics need several flow-throughs before they settle, and a run that is too short produces a confident-looking mean of the start-up transient. 0 or blank defaults to 600 s and says so on the component. Optional.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">1b150bfb-03ef-4905-9d94-6456b31a32e9</item>
