                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PIMPLE only: initial time step in seconds. This is only a SEED - the run uses adjustTimeStep, so the step is re-derived every iteration from the Max Courant limit and climbs away from this value within a few steps. Leave at 0 for the default (0.01 s), which is small enough never to start a run unstable. Optional.</item>
