                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PIMPLE only: Courant number cap that sets the time step. PIMPLE's outer correctors license Co &gt; 1, unlike an explicit scheme. 0 defaults to 2, matching the indoor species path. Raising it buys wall-clock at the cost of time accuracy; lower it if the run goes unstable. Optional.</item>
